body: <p><i>"(U+1F4BB) is a series of videos depicting a group of laptops playing fantasies of spatial occupation in computerized landscapes in which other laptops are the sovereign explorers of Everything's virtual terrains. Their journeys are accompanied by a generative sound piece of cybernetic ambient noise, along with a series of subtitled narratives that allude to conquest chronicles in "exotic lands", which recall the pre-colonial and domestication history in the Americas.</i></p><p><i>*(U+1F4BB) is the name given to a personal computer or laptop in the Unicode code system, and is usually used to refer to digital labors."</i></p>
